repository to the HP's local disk for testing.

It came down to be a corruption in the specific SCCS directory, and it
seemed to affect just this one file.
The problem was resolved by copying the file to a new file, deleting the
original, and renaming the copy to the original name.   The SCCS history
(prs) was preserved through these steps.

