<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN">
<HTML>
<HEAD>
<META HTTP-EQUIV=3D"Content-Type" CONTENT=3D"text/html; =
charset=3Dus-ascii">
<META NAME=3D"Generator" CONTENT=3D"MS Exchange Server version =
5.5.2653.12">
<TITLE>SUMMARY: Printcap and input filters (if:)</TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<P><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">Many thanks to Alan Davis, the answer =
arrived in my intray before my mail asking the question!!</FONT>
<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">I knew this list was good but</FONT> =
<FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">telepathic prescience as well?!?</FONT>
</P>

<P><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">Question:</FONT>
<UL>
<P><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">Does anyone know how I can capture =
what gets passed to the 'if' file defined in printcap?</FONT><FONT =
FACE=3D"Arial"> </FONT>
<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">eg. =
if:/usr/lbin/hplaserof:\</FONT><FONT FACE=3D"Arial"> </FONT>
<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">Can I replace the /usr/lbin/hplaserof =
string with something else to redirect what ever is passed</FONT><FONT =
FACE=3D"Arial"></FONT> <FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">to a text =
file?</FONT><FONT FACE=3D"Arial"> </FONT>
</P>
</UL>
<P><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">Answer:</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier New">Here's how =
I've done it in the past :</FONT>
<BR><FONT FACE=3D"Arial">&nbsp;</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier New">/etc/printcap =
entry :</FONT>
<BR><FONT FACE=3D"Arial">&nbsp;</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier New">test|Test =
entry:\</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier =
New">:if=3D/local/bin/test_lp_filter.ksh:\</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier =
New">:sd=3D/usr/spool/testlp:\</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier =
New">:lf=3D/usr/adm/lperr:\</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier =
New">:lp=3D/dev/null:</FONT>
<BR><FONT FACE=3D"Arial">&nbsp;</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier New">Script =
executed as input filter :</FONT>
<BR><FONT FACE=3D"Arial">&nbsp;</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier =
New">#!/bin/ksh</FONT>
<BR><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Courier New">cat =
&gt;/tmp/test.prn</FONT>
</P>

<P><FONT COLOR=3D"#000000" SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Arial">I have changed =
test.prn to test.$$ so I can save multiple test results</FONT>
</P>

<P><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Tahoma">Kind regards</FONT>
</P>

<P><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Tahoma">Lawrie Smith</FONT>
<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Tahoma">Capita Technical Services</FONT>
<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2 FACE=3D"Tahoma">West Malling</FONT>
</P>

